<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "Liberation Serif", Georgia, serif; }
  h1, h2 { text-align: center; font-weight: bold; }
  .header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 40px; font-size: 0.9em; }
  .form-section { margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .line-item-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .signature-block { margin-top: 50px; }
  .checkbox-group label { margin-right: 15px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 0.8em; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    Office of Clinical Experiences<br>
    <span data-field="employer.address_line_1">{{ employer.address_line_1 }}</span><br>
    <span data-field="employer.address_line_2">{{ employer.address_line_2 }}</span><br>
    Office: <span data-field="employer.phone">{{ employer.phone }}</span><br>
    Fax: <span data-field="employer.fax">{{ employer.fax }}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="width: 100px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">WESTERN MICHIGAN UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">INTERNSHIP EARLY RELEASE APPEAL FORM</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div>Teacher Candidate Name: </div>
      <div>WIN #: </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
      <div>Program: 
        <span data-field="program_options">{{ program_options }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>Minor: </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px; margin-top: 15px;">
      <div>Address: </div>
      <div>City: </div>
      <div>Zip Code: </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px; margin-top: 15px;">
      <div>Telephone Number: </div>
      <div>E-Mail: </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div>INTERNSHIP INFORMATION:</div>
      <div>Clinical Instructor:</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
      <div>Semester: </div>
      <div>Location: </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <strong>REASON FOR EARLY RELEASE APPEAL:</strong>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <div style="text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: 10px;">
      INDEPTH DESCRIPTION OF APPEAL: (MAY ATTACH ADDITIONAL SHEETS)
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px;">
      <div>Teacher Candidate Signature: </div>
      <div>Telephone: </div>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">
      <strong>NOTE:</strong> Please secure the signatures below. Decisions may take up to 10 business days. Interns may need to meet with a committee comprised of faculty, OCE staff, and the Director of Teacher Education.
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <strong>SUPPORTING SIGNATURES:</strong> (ALL SIGNATURES NEEDED FOR APPEAL TO BE ACCEPTED)
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <div>Cooperating Teacher: </div>
      <div>Building Principal: </div>
      <div>Clinical Instructor: </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>All internship seminar assignments have been completed: 
        <span data-field="completed_yes">{{ completed_yes }}</span> 
        <span data-field="completed_no">{{ completed_no }}</span>
      </p>
      <p>I will be available to the intern for the remainder of the semester: 
        <span data-field="available_yes">{{ available_yes }}</span> 
        <span data-field="available_no">{{ available_no }}</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
      <p>In addition, you must submit a letter from the school district stating that you are being hired for a particular teaching position.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
      <strong>ADVISORY BOARD DECISION:</strong>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>Date Received: 
        <span data-field="date_received">{{ date_received }}</span>
      </p>
      <p>Employment Verified: 
        <span data-field="employment_verified_yes">{{ employment_verified_yes }}</span> 
        <span data-field="employment_verified_no">{{ employment_verified_no }}</span>
      </p>
      <p>Verification of cooperating teacher: 
        <span data-field="coop_teacher_yes">{{ coop_teacher_yes }}</span> 
        <span data-field="coop_teacher_no">{{ coop_teacher_no }}</span>
      </p>
      <p>Committee Members Notified: 
        <span data-field="members_notified_yes">{{ members_notified_yes }}</span> 
        <span data-field="members_notified_no">{{ members_notified_no }}</span>
      </p>
      <p>Meeting Necessary: 
        <span data-field="meeting_necessary_yes">{{ meeting_necessary_yes }}</span> 
        <span data-field="meeting_necessary_no">{{ meeting_necessary_no }}</span>
      </p>
      <p>Decision: 
        <span data-field="decision_yes">{{ decision_yes }}</span> 
        <span data-field="decision_no">{{ decision_no }}</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
      <div>Teacher Candidate Notified: </div>
      <div>Mail: </div>
      <div>Date: </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>